"Lute is a Velra, cousin to Aimi and Hazel, who has just turned fifteen."
"He looks about ten: pale, dressed all in black, with a severe expression and a morose voice."
"He is an S-rank whose family paid 1.5 million Argold in a trade for his class."
"One of his S-rank skills, Mass Bestowal, lets his chains buff whole groups."
"He plays harp with art school students; his family thinks music is wasteful."
"While Glossed, his crush asked him out."
"His grandmother Aulia sent him to watch Alden Thorn so Alden would not run."
"At Hannah Elber's funeral he chained to help the student musicians harmonize."
"He expects the Gloss backlash to cost him some fingers."
"He urged Alden to run, and said Hazel is very talented and hard-working."
"By autumn he studies in the CNH Arts program, a school pariah called Cheater."
"He lost his right eye, likely to Gloss backlash, and wears a near-matching prosthetic."
"He is pale blond and very short, and hates his grandmother Aulia eternally."
"He hasn't spoken to Lexi in a year, yet became Alden's roommate with Lexi and Haoyu."
"He once hoped to move to Vienna, and says Chicago makes some of the best harps."
"He advised Alden to attend one tolerable Aulia event so she stops chasing him."
"He wears an eyepatch, lately with a big red X on it."
"His concert harp Angela Aubergine is a purple pedal harp worth about sixty thousand dollars."
"He has a contract tattoo on his lower back, arranged by Aulia."
"He claims a second S-rank skill he won't name, to enrage Aulia."
"His S-rank Chainer class was the one the Velras had long held for Hazel."
"He is summoned to work for an Artonan boss on Artona II, with an official work calendar."
"His hands are enhanced; he never misses a note and does card tricks."
"He soaks in the tub about three hours a night."
"He bestowed the Self Mastery wordchain on Alden and is smitten with Natalie."
"His boss is the wizard Parethat-uur at the Palace of Unbreaking, which embarrasses him."
"His mother is Jessica Velra; his legal father Cyril, a whiff, is likely not his real father."
"He grew up on the megayacht Libra, in the Velra mansion and in Aulia's penthouse."
"He went to a private academy with Haoyu, Vandy, Kon and Tuyet."
"He studied piano from age three, then switched to harp after Hazel's whiff jokes."
"By November he plans a crush on Emilija, and calls Alden Cottontail."
